      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Here's another attempt: \"I love how our neighbors think we're always throwing some kind of fiesta, right? Like, 'Oh, you must be having a huge party because there are 12 people standing in the front yard.' No, we're just trying to cram 12 people into a 2-bedroom apartment without killing each other. But seriously, have you ever noticed how everyone assumes our house is some kind of war zone just because we have a lot of people living together? 'I'm surprised you haven't been evicted yet.' Yeah, that's not because of our questionable landlord or the fact that we're all secretly hoarders, it's just because we're a big, loud, crazy family... and also because we're actually a big, loud, crazy family.\"",
